CATEGORIES:Casual/ Relaxed
DESCRIPTION:The "infectious" (Rhein Main Press)\, "cacophonous bhangra fun
 k band from Brooklyn" (The Telegraph) is “the best party band in years” (
 NPR)\, and they're coming to Montclair for a free outdoor performance in 
 the Amphitheatre! Join PEAK Performances and Red Baraat for a spring cele
 bration of the year with free ice cream and other free things for Montcla
 ir students.\nRed Baraat is a pioneering band from Brooklyn\, New York. C
 onceived by dhol player Sunny Jain\, the group has drawn worldwide praise
  for its singular sound\, a merging of hard driving Punjabi rhythms with 
 elements of hip-hop\, jazz and raw punk energy. The band’s live shows are
  an unparalleled collision of virtuosity\, party\, and joy\, as Red Baraa
 t reminds us that we are truly all in this together. Red Baraat has toure
 d the globe the past 16 years with stops at Bonnaroo\, Austin City Limits
 \, Bumbershoot\, New Orleans Jazz Fest\, Peter Gabriel’s WOMAD festivals 
 (Australia\, New Zealand\, Spain\, UK)\, Dubai World Expo 2021\, just to 
 name a few. Along the way they sold out rooms as diverse as the Luxembour
 g Philharmonic and the New York City’s legendary rock club Bowery Ballroo
 m\, and performed at the request of The White House (Obama)\, TED\, Londo
 n Olympic Games\, David Byrne\, Padma Lakshmi and recent NYC Mayor-elect\
 , Zohran Mamdani. Red Baraat have released 7 albums with numerous accolad
 es from major media outlets and ranked in top 10 lists on Billboard\, App
 le Music and World Music Charts Europe.\n\nHosted by: PEAK Performances\n
 \nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.co
 m/engage/event/12423694
DTEND:20260424T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260424T031631Z
DTSTART:20260424T160000Z
GEO:40.860280;-74.199820
LOCATION:Amphitheatre
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Red Baraat in the Amphitheatre
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12423694
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12423694
X-HOSTS:PEAK Performances
END:VEVENT
