DESCRIPTION:Join us for a short student focus group to share your thoughts
  on Health Promotion services at Montclair State University.\nWe’re looki
 ng to better understand student experiences\, needs\, and how services ca
 n be improved. Your feedback will directly contribute to enhancing studen
 t support on campus.\nEach session will last approximately 20–30 minutes 
 and will be conducted in a small group setting.\n \n🗓 Available Sessions
 :\n• Friday April 24th: 2:00–3:00 PM\n• Friday April 24th: 3:00–4:00 PM\n
 📍 Location: Drop-In Center (Located in between the Student Center and Ri
 chardson Hall.)\n💻 Google Meet option available\n \nPlease RSVP to reser
 ve your spot.\nAll responses will be kept confidential and used only for 
 a class research project. We will not collect names during the discussion
  - only general feedback and demographics.\nWe appreciate your time and i
 nput!\n\nHosted by: Office of Health Promotion\n\nAdditional Information 
 can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12434690
DTEND:20260424T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260424T031631Z
DTSTART:20260424T180000Z
LOCATION:Drop-In Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Health Promotion Student Focus Group
