DESCRIPTION:The Montclair State University Fashion Design and Merchandisin
 g program is preparing to unveil its highly anticipated annual juried fas
 hion show\, titled “A Moment in Time.” Making its way to the runway this 
 week\, the event serves as a premier showcase for the technical skill and
  artistic vision of students across all levels of the program.\n \nJoin u
 s for Montclair State University’s annual fashion show where creativity\,
  experimentation\, and serious talent take center stage. From first stitc
 hes to advanced draping\, this show brings together designers at every le
 vel pushing boundaries and redefining what fashion can be.\n \nExpect bol
 d looks\, unexpected silhouettes\, and a runway full of moments you’ll wa
 nt to pause and take in. Think distortion\, discovery\, and pure creative
  energy.\n \n👗 Featuring work from:Intro to Apparel ConstructionIntermed
 iate Apparel ConstructionFlat PatternDraping\nand Independent Designers\n
  \n🧥 Special collab with Rocky’s Closet showing how you can serve looks 
 without breaking the bank\n \n🏆 Judged by industry pros + scholarships a
 warded\n \n📍 Memorial Auditorium🗓 Friday\, April 24🚪 Doors 5:30 PM | S
 how 6 PM\n🎟 $12 presale | $15 at the door\n \nGrab your tickets now: htt
 ps://engagement.montclair.edu/e/montclair-state-university-2026-fashion-s
 how/\nOr Scan QR code \n \nDon’t blink… you might miss the moment 👀\n \n
  \n\nHosted by: Art and Design\n\nAdditional Information can be found at:
  https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12441317
